{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re a moose on a diving adventure. Swim into the ocean and vacuum coins from the seabed. Sell the coins and earn money to upgrade and buy new gear. Swim deeper and find treasure chests to collect power boosting artefacts, but don\u2019t forget to keep an eye on your oxygen level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738330/extras/9311e6008f5aea6215854e33e24c4b86.avif?t=1762768736\" alt=\"Vacuum coins\" width=512 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the water and vacuum coins from the seabed with your coin vacuum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738330/extras/547bb19bc6e1866959d4f9fb13d07b91.poster.avif?t=1762768736\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738330/extras/547bb19bc6e1866959d4f9fb13d07b91.webm?t=1762768736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738330/extras/547bb19bc6e1866959d4f9fb13d07b91.mp4?t=1762768736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738330/extras/29b21db76789a905b3c817c7dfe68030.avif?t=1762768736\" alt=\"Sell and upgrade\" width=598 height=91 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell the coins to <strong>Coin Collector Sir Floaty II Seahorse of Kiddie Pool</strong> he will pay a fair price for them. Use the money earned to buy upgrades to your gear and more in <strong>Barkie McBarkie\u2019s Divin gear n Stuff</strong>. He has the best prices on the island.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738330/extras/6ce668ec1f3210bde7a5fcacdfb26bc4.avif?t=1762768736\" alt=\"Dive deeper\" width=442 height=108 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your upgraded gear you will reach deeper parts of the ocean which hold more valuable coins, treasure chests and maybe some hidden caves. But mind your oxygen level so you don\u2019t drown and lose the coins you have collected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738330/extras/48ec435e646cfc3188e44c4df3f519c6.poster.avif?t=1762768736\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738330/extras/48ec435e646cfc3188e44c4df3f519c6.webm?t=1762768736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738330/extras/48ec435e646cfc3188e44c4df3f519c6.mp4?t=1762768736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 coin types and 16 gem types appearing as you get deeper into the ocean</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large map of ~67 sq km with millions of coins and gems to vacuum up</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of gear upgrades to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many different artefacts to find and collect with different power boosts</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Bootlicker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3738330/28fea8489fcb126705786c19d657e98919e05e6f.jpg"},{"name":"Message in a bottle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3738330/284fde170b4485c